# MASTER PROMPT — ULTRA-PREMIUM MEDICAL & HOSPITAL APPOINTMENT BOOKING WEBSITE

## 1. Your Mission

Act as a world-class website designer, senior frontend engineer, healthcare UX specialist, motion designer, and full-stack developer.

Build an exceptionally premium, elegant, modern, trustworthy, and fully functional medical and hospital appointment-booking website. The website should feel like a premium private hospital brand combined with Apple's design quality, the sophistication of a luxury healthcare company, and the usability of a world-class digital healthcare platform.

This is NOT a basic doctor website, a simple hospital landing page, or an ordinary appointment form.

Create a complete healthcare website experience where patients can explore medical services, discover doctors, check availability, book appointments, understand consultation pricing in Indian rupees, and receive clear appointment confirmations.

The design must be sophisticated, visually rich, professionally structured, responsive, accessible, and production-oriented.

**Creative freedom:** You have the freedom to make professional design decisions, select the strongest layout, develop a unique visual identity, and implement premium animations. Do not compromise on quality, functionality, or usability.

Do not just describe the website or provide a design concept. Build the actual working website.

